            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Strategy guides and other resources available at </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy Drew®: Secret of the Old Clock is a first-person perspective, point-and-click adventure game.  The player is Nancy Drew and has to solve a mystery. Explore rich environments for clues, interrogate suspects, and solve puzzles and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\tThe year is 1930.  A fiery explosion at the Lilac Inn leaves its owner, Emily Crandall, teetering on the edge of sanity and propels you, as Nancy Drew, headlong into adventure.  A will left behind by an eccentric millionaire could solve Emily’s problems, and fortunately, you’ve got a car and can drive anywhere you want.  But watch out!  When you’re on the trail of a desperate villain, the road can get very bumpy!  Dare to Play.™</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Nancy’s blue roadster<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back in time to 1930<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play miniature golf<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the first Nancy Drew book<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Nancy Drew Adventure Series</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/31930/extras/ND_logo.jpg\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original #1 selling PC adventure series. </p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy Drew®: Secret of the Old Clock is a first-person perspective, point-and-click adventure game.  The player is Nancy Drew and has to solve a mystery. Explore rich environments for clues, interrogate suspects, and solve puzzles and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\tThe year is 1930.  A fiery explosion at the Lilac Inn leaves its owner, Emily Crandall, teetering on the edge of sanity and propels you, as Nancy Drew, headlong into adventure.  A will left behind by an eccentric millionaire could solve Emily’s problems, and fortunately, you’ve got a car and can drive anywhere you want.  But watch out!  When you’re on the trail of a desperate villain, the road can get very bumpy!  Dare to Play.™</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Nancy’s blue roadster<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back in time to 1930<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play miniature golf<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the first Nancy Drew book<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Nancy Drew Adventure Series</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/31930/extras/ND_logo.jpg\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original #1 selling PC adventure series. </p>",
